# The real exports are large and carry their own licence (OpenStreetMap
# data is under the ODbL): keep them out of the repository. Only the
# hand-written sample and the READMEs are committed. This also covers the
# downloads in osm/ and boundaries/ (tools/import_schools/fetch_osm_schools.py).
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!categories.json
!review/
!review/decisions.csv
!review/README.md
!check_names.example.txt
!sample/
!sample/**
